ps toward something that feels right for you. What have you been focusing on since then? Redirecting your energy into new creative pursuits can be incredibly liberating, allowing you to thrive as an artist in your own right and explore territories you've always wanted to delve into.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"What creative hobbies or activities has the user previously enjoyed or expressed interest in?\", \"id\": \"creative_interests\"}]"
